{
  "about": "Refactor 17, Stage B, decision D1: the foundation module agent becomes the workspace package @purin-labs/agent in foundation/agent. scripts/refactor-17/move-module.mjs reads this plan. files: each source file that scripts/layers.json gives the module, with its place in the target folder. sourcePrefixes: where --sync-plan puts a file that the module gets later. package: the manifest and the tsconfig of the new package; the versions of devDependencies come from versionsFrom. edits: text edits of the files that name a root folder and cannot read scripts/lib/source-roots.mjs, and of a path that is no import; an edit is done when the file holds its replace text. keepForm: each file where an import stays on its line, because the wrap of Prettier would move a ratchet, with its reason. regenerate: the commands that write a generated file again. package.typeCheck false: the package has no check:types script of its own. Its own files read the Env keys ORGANISATION and CASE, which services/platform/src/actors/organisation.ts and actors/case.ts (workers/platform) merge with declare module of @purin-labs/kernel/env, the parts of CommerceTypeParts that services/platform/src/commerce/contract/types.ts (areas/commerce) merges (relationshipRef, listEntryRef, listId, graphQuery and others), and the module type *.wasm?module that the Worker declares. Through @purin-labs/tenancy, @purin-labs/actor-runtime and @purin-labs/authority the program also lacks SESSION and CONNECTOR. The package alone gives 96 errors, 52 of them in its own files. The Worker program checks its files.",
